      "message": "While proposing aosp/4380071 to add `vfio_platform_unregister_reset()` and `__vfio_platform_register_reset()` functions to the ABI symbol list, the reviewer was concerned that there are too many symbols to be added due to dependencies.\n\nAs @smostafa@google.com also had a similar concern at the other comment above, I\u0027d suggest hiding and keeping this `struct vfio_platform_device` (and region and irq) in `vfio_platform_private.h` file, and updating `vfio_platform_reset_fn_t` to receive `struct device *` pointer instead. I expect that this will also require updating `of_reset()` callback and 3 in-tree reset drivers though.",
